  objectiveItem: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8406208b4a12b3844b9e7722af463c80, type: 2}
  objectiveSummary: 'Recover Othelia''s signet ring'
  objectiveLocation: 'Castle treasure tower'
  questGiverName: 'Othelia'
  inProgressText: 'Have you reached the castle''s tower yet? The creatures serving the curse hoard their plunder up there.'
  readyText: 'Is that a glint of gold in your hand? Please, tell me you found it!'
  turnInOptionText: 'Your family''s signet ring, returned to you.'
  thanksText: 'My ancestors'' seal, home at last! Take this Rune of Fate. And carry the ring back to the castle for me: our family says the old King could refuse its wearer nothing. Show it to him when his stone is thickest.'
  completedText: 'The ring is yours to carry until the curse is broken. Oakhaven owes you more than it can ever repay.'
